{title: Gehra Hua}
{artist: Arijit Singh}
{movie: Dhurandhar}
{key: Em}
{c: Capo on 3rd Fret (Original Key: Gm)}
{c: Strumming Pattern: D DU UDU or D D U UD D DU}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em]Tu agar meri ye [D]hawaayein teri
[C]Tu agar meri saari [D]raahein teri
[Em]Tu agar meri main [D]hoon tera [C]

[Em]Tu agar meri ye [D]ujaale tere
[C]Tu agar meri dil [D]hawaale tere
[Em]Tu agar meri main [D]hoon tera [C]

{c: Pre-Chorus}
[Em]Betaab sa mohabbbat ka [D]tu inqalab hai
[C]Mera jahan teri baahon mein [D]khaab khaab hai

{c: Chorus}
[Em]Gehra hua, [D]gehra hua
[C]Rang aashiqui, [D]gehra hua
[Em]Gehra hua, [D]gehra hua
[C]Dariya dua, [D]gehra hua

{c: Verse 2}
[Em]Teri panahon mein [D]meri subah hai
[C]Tere bina har [D]pal dhuan hai
[Em]Tu jo kahe toh [D]sadqe utaarun
[C]Tere bina main [D]khud ko na jaanu

{c: Pre-Chorus}
[Em]Betaab sa mohabbbat ka [D]tu inqalab hai
[C]Mera jahan teri baahon mein [D]khaab khaab hai

{c: Chorus}
[Em]Gehra hua, [D]gehra hua
[C]Rang aashiqui, [D]gehra hua
[Em]Gehra hua, [D]gehra hua
[C]Dariya dua, [D]gehra hua
